WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Nouli reads your agent's model calls.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.500
It groups the calls into jobs and prices each one.

00:12.500 --> 00:19.000
It splits a job into steps and picks what each one runs on.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.500
It tests the steps against your agent on live calls.

00:25.500 --> 00:32.000
It moves traffic over in stages, and back if answers drift.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
The inference bill drops.
